# doc/

Rustdoc-generated HTML and JavaScript documentation for the Rust crate ecosystem. This directory contains static assets and interactive components for browsing API documentation, including help pages, settings, and source code navigation.

## Files

- `help.html` -- Rustdoc help and keyboard shortcuts documentation page
- `settings.html` -- User settings and preference configuration page
- `src-files.js` -- Source code file structure and sidebar navigation registry
- `crates.js` -- Complete crate catalog and fragment metadata for doc pages
- `.lock` -- Build artifact lock file
